{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2bf","chatId":"c2ac0d006b3743f18bb331b7fde5d773","sessionId":null,"userId":68546,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1047,"promptTokens":1488,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0075730851504765785,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2be","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722735,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2be","chatId":"c2ac0d006b3743f18bb331b7fde5d773","sessionId":null,"userId":68546,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小尤兴奋地准备向团队展示他的创新想法。在会议中，他的老板对他的细节和表达不清楚进行了严厉的批评。小尤分析了老板的评论，并意识到这种严厉的反馈是他进步的必要条件。他重新阅读了自己的笔记，开始完善他的想法。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小尤最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 充满希望\nB) 害怕\nC) 绝望\nD) 反对\nE) 悔恨\nF) 尴尬\n\n## 问题 2\n小尤为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 虽然这些严厉的评论让他感到伤心和失望，但他意识到他可以做得更好，并开始完善\nB) 他的老板总是会批评小尤\nC) 他的老板赞扬了小尤的努力\nD) 小尤喜欢向团队展示他的想法。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0075730851504765785,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2bf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722733,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"71f6c2302e9545b48f95fc1f8b5ce1b0"}